# LanceHive Core

**Stack:** Laravel 13 · PHP 8.3+ · PostgreSQL 18 · Sail · Sanctum API · Pest · API **`/api/v1`**

## Commands (always via Sail)

`vendor/bin/sail artisan …` · `vendor/bin/sail artisan test --compact {path}` · `vendor/bin/sail bin pint --dirty --format agent`

## Architecture (one line)

Feature slices under `app/Features/{Name}/` (not versioned) · route files in `routes/features/v1/` · URLs `/api/v1` via `config/api.php` · tests `tests/Feature/{Name}/` + `$this->apiUrl()`.

## Token guard

1. **Do not** read all of `docs/` — open **one** doc when needed (see table).
2. **Do not** re-read `AGENTS.md` / `CLAUDE.md` if a scoped `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` already covers the path.
3. Use Boost MCP (`search-docs`, `database-schema`, `database-query`) before opening migration files or grepping the repo.
4. For build tasks, read **only** the current task block in `docs/multi-tenant/implementation-tasks.md` via `lancehive-build-task` skill.
5. Run the **narrowest** test file after each change — never the full suite unless asked.

